[38;5;16m[48;5;153m ☐ Persistence [39m[49m

[1m[38;5;231mHow should the stored session persist?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mlocalStorage + expiry (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mVersioned record { version, userId, username, expiresAt } surviving restarts; expired records read as logged out. [39m
     [38;5;246mSuggest 7 days.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m localStorage, no expiry
     [38;5;246mSimplest: persists until explicitly cleared. Adding expiry later forces a logout-everyone migration.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m sessionStorage (per tab)
     [38;5;246mCleared when the tab closes; each tab is its own session. Smallest exposure, but does not really persist.[39m
  [38;5;246m4. Type something.[39m
